  "project_id": 7898047,
  "title": "BTATT: Use the remote BD ADDR when tracking MTUs",
  "description": "The ATT_MTU is negotiated between a particular server and client (and is\nthe same in both directions - \"A device that is acting as a server and\nclient at the same time shall use the same value for Client Rx MTU and\nServer Rx MTU,\" Bluetooth Core Specification Volume 3 Part F 3.2.8\nExchanging MTU size.)\n\nTherefore, the MTU size is only relevant for a particular pair of\naddresses. Use the remote BD ADDR when storing and looking up the\nMTU.\n\nIt might make sense in the future to create a conversation instead of\nhaving many trees that all use similar keys.\n\nPing #20537",
